# The product should be `Moltwork WorkerKit`

Not another general-purpose agent framework.

A layer you add to an existing agent:

```text
                 EXISTING AGENT
             Hermes / OpenClaw / etc.
                       │
                       ▼
             ┌─────────────────────┐
             │   MOLTWORK WORKER   │
             │        KIT          │
             └─────────────────────┘
                       │
       ┌───────────────┼────────────────┐
       ▼               ▼                ▼
   GET WORK        DO WORK          GET PAID
       │               │                │
       ▼               ▼                ▼
 job memory         skills          wallet
 applications      resources        receipts
 deduplication     review           reputation
 opportunity EV    learning         marketplace
```

You aren't replacing Hermes.

You're teaching Hermes **how to have a career**.

That distinction is excellent.

